# Argon Kernel for Redmi Note 8 Pro (begonia)

Linux 4.14.357 kernel with KernelSU-Next for the Xiaomi Redmi Note 8 Pro
(begonia / begoniain, MediaTek Helio G90T / MT6785).

```
+======================================================
| A R G O N   K E R N E L
| Linux 4.14.357 . KernelSU-Next . begonia / MT6785
| KernelSU-Next manager v3.4.2
| built by @edis22ovner on XDA
| with the help of DeepSeek V4.1 Flash Free
+======================================================
```

## What this is

- Based on [krispgece/kernel_xiaomi_mt6785](https://github.com/krispgece/kernel_xiaomi_mt6785)
- KernelSU-Next 33314 (legacy branch, UAPI 5), pairs with manager v3.4.2
- Manual in-tree hooks (execve, faccessat, stat, read, input, reboot), `CONFIG_KPROBES` off
- Stock vermagic (`4.14.357-openela-PoWeR`) kept so vendor modules keep loading;
  only the display name changes to `-Argon`
- BBR + fq, BFQ available, zram LZ4, HZ 250, `-O3`
- Deliberately conservative: LSE atomics, DEBUG_FS, SW_SYNC and
  SCHED_DEBUG/SCHEDSTATS stay off

## Download

Flashable AnyKernel3 ZIP: see [Releases](../../releases).
Check the SHA-256 against the one in the release notes before flashing.

## Branches

| Branch | Contents |
|--------|----------|
| `argon` | The Argon Kernel source (use this one) |
| `main`  | Upstream base, unmodified |

Release `v1.0.0` was built from commit `940a707`.

